  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>\"Heads, I win. Tails, you lose. Hey, what's that over there!?\"</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Three Card Monty, character level 7th</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> After you use your Monty deck, put all of its portents into your discard pile. The portents that make up your Monty deck can now be shuffled back into your active deck, or otherwise interacted with, just like any other portent in your discard pile.</p>\n<p><strong>Normal:</strong> Once used, the Monty deck is set aside. It does not go into the discard pile, and it does not get shuffled into the active deck.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/cartomancy-feats#toc39\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
